        "text": "*   **Oleate (`1,000 mg/day` fasted) + Ambroxol (`30 mg/day`) + Batyl alcohol (+ `11,11-D2-linoleate` `F01`):** `Oleate` supplies specific membrane export lipid marks; `ambroxol` drives intracellular glucocerebrosidase (`GCase`) lipid salvage via the `LIMP-2` address (bypassing the `M6P` pathway stranded by FGFR blockade); `batyl alcohol` supplies sn\\-1sn\\\\text{-1}sn\\-1 ether lipids for COPII/Golgi vesicle fusion while deuterated linoleate prevents lipid peroxidation."
