        "mechanism": "Collagen material connects the build and consolidation phases. The substrate pool supports new matrix only when translation, hydroxylation, folding and export can carry it through. A larger amino-acid input cannot relieve a blocked Golgi or convert an unprocessed hypertrophic queue.",
